window.products.push({"id":287022,"name":"Ambesonne Gnome Fitted Sheet & Pillow Sham Set, Nordic Tonttu Myth Finnish Creature Nisser Scandinavian Folklore Print, Decorative Printed 2 Piece Bed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xKLnDfjXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Measurements - 1 twin size sheet 39\" wide X 75\" long & 1 pillow sham 30\" wide X 20\" long. Made from - Super soft 100% brushed microfiber fabric. Sheet and sham set with modern prints. Features - All-round elastic pocket, fits mattresses up to 16\". Sham has an envelope closure. Machine washable - In cold cycle. Sturdy. Comfortable and decorative for bedrooms, hotels, dorms. Printed - With state of the art digital printing technology. Items Printed on the front side only. Give yourself a great gift and refresh your bedroom every season by buying our sheet set with pillow sham and sheet. These pillow sham and sheet can greatly change the vibe of your bedroom while also allowing you to get more comfortable in your bed. 100% brushed microfiber fabric of these products allow you to experience the ultimate comfort with the softness. Envelope closures on the pillow shams make it easier for you to use them. Choose your favorite pattern out of 10's of thousands of different ones and decorate your bedroom as you please. You can make a difference by changing the look of your room, guest room and hotel room. The fabric is 100% recyclable and environmentally friendly. The colors of the set won't fade due to our digital printing methods. It's the perfect gift for your friend, mother, father, boyfriend, girlfriend, cousin, uncle, aunt, grandfather, and grandmother. Surprise them with our high quality set of shams and sheet. The digital images we display have the most accurate color possible, however, due to differences in computer monitors, we cannot be responsible for variations in color between the actual product and your screen. Due to manual measurement, please kindly allow a 1-2 cm discrepancy. The Sheet and Pillow Shams are printed on the Front side only, the back of them are plain white-colored.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xKLnDfjXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ambesonne","source_asin":"B0BPCYD7PT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-287022","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPCYD7PT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPCYD7PT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":287023,"name":"Luxxetta Office Computer Desk - 55” x 23” Teak Laminated Wooden Particleboard Table and White Powder Coated Steel Frame - Work or Home - Easy Assembly","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81P7miVXNrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Upgrade your computer set up with Luxxetta's super modern and stable Series CD140 Computer Desk! A perfect fit for any room! You spend hours on your desk working, writing, reading, and doing all sorts of things so you might as well get a desk that not only fits everything you need, but looks and feels great. Perfect for any setting, let Luxxetta improve the quality of your work or home environment with the a brand new strong and stylish computer desk. PRODUCT FEATURES - Dimensions: 55\" Wide x 23.6\" Deep x 29.5” High- Weight Capacity: 900 lbs.- Laminated Particle Board + Stainless Steel- Assembly Tools and Instructions Included- Great Simple and Modern Design for Home and Office THE PERFECT WORKSTATION Get your daily tasks done or play an online game - whatever you need, our desks come through with everything you need to make your workstation one that you can live in forever. With a 61 inch long table, you are provided with a lot more space than you're used to. Place your laptop, books, music players, video games consoles, toys, collectibles, fancy displays, anything on top! Great for college students to study in complete luxury and personalize to fit their style. PREMIUM QUALITY Everything from the look and feel of the desk is made to impress. Laminated particle board and powder coated steel make for a power combination that is sure to provide excellent stability and sturdiness. It's able to withstand up to 900 pounds so you have more than enough room to play with. Assemble it easily by following the provided instruction and using the tools packaged. You will find that our computer desk feels like nothing else! With Luxxetta you're getting nothing but the best and strongest computer desks out there with great durability, incredible strength, and great usability. Get yours today and enhance the look and feel of your home and office!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81P7miVXNrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Luxxetta","source_asin":"B078JQFKZR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-287023","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078JQFKZR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078JQFKZR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
