window.products.push({"id":287053,"name":"Fanwer Anti Slip Strip Non-Slip Shower Stickers High Grip Tread Tape, Suitable for Bathroom, Bathtub, Swimming Pool, Stairway, Treads & Steps","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iAlNQJ44L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【 Design Principle】：Each non-slip stickers are made of EVA acrylic waterproof adhesive material, and the frosted texture is used to increase friction, so there is no need to worry about slipping. At the same time, this design is meant to allow water to flow freely further reducing the chances of soapy water accumulating. 【Advantages】The non slip are designed to stick firmly on smooth surfaces offering strong adhesion and a great grip. Further, provides you with long-lasting slip and fall protection. The special glue used for these stickers can easily be removed without leaving any residue behind. And to top it all up, the stickers are non-toxic, fade-free, safe, and convenient to use. 【How to use】Just three steps: first clean the floor with a cleaning cloth, alcohol, or detergent. Second, tear off the back glue, part of which is attached to the ground, and then tear off the other parts and attach them completely. Finally, press and fit the pasted patch. 【Scope of application】：The bathtub non slip stickers have strong adhesion and grip and is suitable for under the floor of bathrooms, kitchens, doors, and on the steps of bathtubs, showers, stairs, and wheelchair pedals. Reducing the risk of accidental slips 【Smile service】： we value every customer who buys products from us on Amazon, and each product provides a 100% satisfaction guarantee. If you are not satisfied with the product for any reason, please contact us to serve you 24 hours and return the product for a full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iAlNQJ44L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"wefaner","source_asin":"B07GDHTNLP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-287053","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GDHTNLP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GDHTNLP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
