window.products.push({"id":287060,"name":"Personalized Etched Glass Whiskey Decanter 23oz Fathers Day Gift, Groomsmen Gift, Monogrammed Gifts, Engraved Christmas Bourbon Gifts for Men, Halpert","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":47.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71se0Ve-RLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Decanting is a time–honored tradition that dates back to the invention of liquor itself. Keep that tradition alive and descant in style with the personalized Etched glass decanter from the Spotted Dog Company. Engrave your name, the name of your friend, family member, or loved one, and experience for yourself the elegance that comes with custom engraved monograms. Each clear glass decanter holds 23.75 ounces of your preferred whiskey, rye, rum, or other liquor, and will make any bar look more appealing. This decanter is made with thick glass, yet is not overly heavy, making each pour effortless and clean. Makes the perfect gift for weddings, Father's day, housewarmings, celebrations, anniversaries, birthdays, or holidays. Personalized monogram’s never go out of style, and the optional line of texts help make this decanter unique to its recipient. The Spotted Dog Company etches our glassware in the USA so we can be assured of its high quality. Our small team works hard to bring you glassware that is delicately etched and completely personal. Laser etched design is permanent and dishwasher safe, so you don’t need to worry about the design ever washing or fading away. Gift wrap ready and ideal for the sophisticated drinker in your life. We tightly bundle your glassware is bubble wrap so it arrives to you ready for you to gift wrap. Click Customize Now to get started; your custom text will be engraved exactly as typed, so please check for spelling and grammar prior to submitting. Backside message available; complete your personalized gift with additional text on the back of the glass.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71se0Ve-RLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Spotted Dog Company","source_asin":"B08CNLS365","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-287060","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CNLS365","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CNLS365","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
