window.products.push({"id":287104,"name":"Macro Sen Bathroom Rug, Non-Slip Bath Mat Rug for Bathroom, Soft Chenille Super Absorbent Washable Bathmat Carpet for Bathtub and Shower Floor(Light G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Pvvkc0zKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★【Non-Slip & Safety】-Nonskid bottom is made of high-quality mesh PVC material, which can effectively prevent the small bath mat from slipping. Nice for wood floor, laminate floor, tile... Keep the elderly and children safer.（WARNING：Place bathroom mat on Clean Dry Floor only. Water under bathmat can cause it to slip. Keep bottom of bathroom carpet dry. Before using bath mats for bathroom, test with foot to ensure it doesn't move.） ★【Ultra Absorbent】-High-pile, dense chenille absorbs extra moisture helping to keep your floor clean while you're stepping out of the bath, shower, or getting ready by the sink. Our super absorbent floor mat can be used at bath room, shower room, tub, living room, kitchen, Kids' Bath or anywhere you want. ★【Easy Washable & Quick Dry】-The bath rugs for bathroom is easy to clean. Hand wash with cold water and mild detergent , hang to dry or air dry flat. Color will keep bright no matter how many times wash and dry!（REMIND：In order to extend the service life, please use the hand wash instead of the machine wash.） ★【1.38 inches Shaggy Chenille】-The bathroom floor mat is composed of 3 layers: Luxury fluffy chenille fabric layer, middle sponge layer and bottom non-slip PVC layer. The thick chenille pile is up to 1.38 inches, keeping your feet warm and dry in the chilly morning. Also a good choice for your pet in the winter. ★【One Year Warranty】-Our bath rugs are covered under a one-year warranty policy. If you have any questions with our toilet rug mat, please feel free to contact us at any time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Pvvkc0zKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Macro Sen","source_asin":"B09KN2ZNY5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-287104","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KN2ZNY5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KN2ZNY5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
