window.products.push({"id":287208,"name":"Handheld Electric Milk Frother, XBrands Mini Milk Frother, Portable Milk Mixer, Powerful Electric Foam Maker with Double Stainless Steel Spring Whisk ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZOylWa1JL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"☕ Great Design & Convenient To Use This mini milk frother has a powerful and ultra-quiet motor that produces a creamy foam in about 15-20 seconds. This handheld Mini Milk Frother looks great. With a double-layer mixing head, it is more powerful and more effective. Lightweight and easy to move and carry. Even if you go out for a picnic, you can take it with you and give your family the best enjoyment. ☕ It's Not Just a Milk Frother You can make your own professional foam coffee, hot chocolate and many other delicious hot and cold drinks at home. Enjoy a variety of coffee at home every day. No need for bulky cappuccino machines. The milk mixer will make the thickest, most foamy, creamy milk in seconds. ＜Features & Benefits＞ ✔Use one-button design. ✔Whisking head is removable, easy to clean. ✔Two whisking head, suitable for different needs. ✔Made of high quality stainless steel, does not rust, durable. ✔Battery Operated: 3 AAA Batteries Operated. ✔It can be used anywhere, as coffee, but also suitable for milkshakes, --cocktails, eggs, cream, soups, dressings, sauces and other dishes. Note: 1.Our mini frother needs to use three AAA batteries, the package does not have a battery.2.Do not wash the handle. 3.Wash the milk frother before and after each use. 4.If the speed starts to slow down or the mixing head shakes, it means you need to replace the battery. 5. If the product is not used for a long time, please make sure that the battery inside the product has been taken out and stored in a safe place. How to Use: ▼ STEP 1: Pick the head of the milk frother and fix it firmly to the body.▼ STEP 2: Turn and open the case cover, insert 3 AAA batteries.▼ STEP 3: Press the button, the milk frother will work. Package Includes: - 1x Milk Frother  - 1x Double Spring Head - 1x Single Spring Head - 1x Instruction","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZOylWa1JL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HCE","source_asin":"B07JZ6CRG6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-287208","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JZ6CRG6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JZ6CRG6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
