window.products.push({"id":287273,"name":"Mary Lake-Thompson Bichon Present Cotton Flour Sack Dish Towel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JmrbSUP5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Vintage flour sack towels have remained the cook's favorite kitchen textile for well over a hundred years. They were initially made using salvaged fabric from old flour or grain sacks which were bleached, washed, and trimmed to size. While modern methods have facilitated mass production and beautiful graphics, the practicality of the original flour sack towels remains. Nothing can beat their absorbency, softness, and virtually lint-free performance, making them perfect for drying everything from everyday dishes to crystal stemware. Mary Lake-Thompson studied art at the University of Colorado and the San Francisco Art Institute. She and her husband, Richard, met in the 70s and began a journey that has taken them from selling original prints at local art shows to a nationally recognized brand. Mary Lake-Thompson, Ltd. has designed and produced soaps, aprons, bath products, drawer liners, sachets, napkins, hats, and of course, their signature flour sack towels. The company is located in Oroville, California and now employs about 50 people. Mary's daughter, Sara, continues the tradition through her own, modern take on classic housewares called Montgomery Street Designs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JmrbSUP5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mary Lake-Thompson","source_asin":"B07FYRSPXS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-287273","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FYRSPXS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FYRSPXS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":287274,"name":"Tommy Bahama Set of 2 Highboy 4 Position Beach Chairs 15 Inch Seat Height with Cupholder, Side Storage Pouch and Mobile Phone Holder","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":189.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qnCVXkTqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Tommy Bahama 15-inch higher seating beach chair provides all day comfort outdoors. Easily get in and out of the chair with the extended seat height. The 15-inch folding beach chair by Tommy Bahama features 4 different reclining options. The molded armrests include the built-in SAFE-ADJUST technology that prevent fingers and hands from getting pinched while adjusting the chair recline. Additionally, the molded armrests are extra wide and contoured to provide maximum elbow and forearm comfort. The armrests include convenient features like a built-in cup holder, cell phone slot and bottle opener. The Tommy Bahama 15-inch portable beach chair is built for the Big/Tall. Featuring an extended seat height and higher backrest, the portable beach chair can support up to 250 lbs. The rust-proof, heavy duty aluminum frame is built strong. The patented locking brackets reinforces the chair strength and also prevents the chair from folding or collapsing while in use. Sit back and relax with your feet in the sand all day long. When not at the beach, take anywhere outdoors. Ideal for concerts in the park, sitting on the sideline, relaxing in your backyard lawn, or using on the campground by the lake. The 15-inch beach chair is lightweight and weighs only 8 lbs. The outdoor chair includes an adjustable padded carry strap for easy portability. The compact folding design takes up little storage space in the car or at home. SEAT HEIGHT: 15“off the ground WEIGHT CAPACITY: 250 lbs. OPEN DIMENSIONS : 28\" x 26.25\" x 37.5\" FOLDED DIMENSIONS: 28\" x 6.25\" x 35\" CHAIR WEIGHT: 8 lbs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qnCVXkTqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tommy Bahama","source_asin":"B09MR2RKRC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-287274","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MR2RKRC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MR2RKRC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
