window.products.push({"id":287445,"name":"Aluminum Round Cake Pans, OAMCEG 3 PCS (4\"/7\"/9\") Professional Nonstick & Leakproof Round Baking Pans Layer Cake Pans Tin Set with Removable Bottom fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YakceDyDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍩 COST-EFFECTIVE 3 SET - There are three sizes of cake pan set (4'', 7'', 9''), and you can freely choose the size of the mold to make the right number of cakes. The cake made by the 4'' mold is suitable for single-person enjoyment, 7'' for 3-4 people, and 9'' for 4-6 people. 🍪 HIGH-QUALITY MATERIALS - Made of aluminum alloy material, tasteless, durable, fast thermal conductivity and good baking effect. Notice: Choose soft tools and mild detergent when you clean it to protect non-stick coating. Avoid sharp and rough tools to scratch the pan. 🎂 EASY CAKE RELEASE: Featuring a removable bottom, our unique push pan makes cake release simple and fuss-free. Simply push the bottom up to 'de-pan' your dessert; no need to scrape around the edges or flip your cake upside down for removal. Our cheesecake pan is perfect for those delicate desserts where you desire the top to preserve its beauty. 🍰 NON-REACTIVE ANODIZED ALUMINUM - Anodizing creates a durable and safe finish which prevents corrosion and discoloration, plus protects the flavor of your baked goods. The non-reactive finish allows you to bake a wider variety of desserts, even those which contain citrus ingredients, without worrying about cross-contamination. 🍥 MULTI-PURPOSE - The durable, non-reactive finish and rolled edges allow this pan to be used for a variety of recipes beyond just cheesecake. Enjoy ice cream cakes, casseroles, deep dish pizza, gelatin desserts, tiramisu and so many more sinful and savory recipes. The bottom of this versatile cake pan also performs double duty as a serving tray for the ideal presentation of your beautifully baked creation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YakceDyDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OAMCEG","source_asin":"B09M64HSPL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-287445","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09M64HSPL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09M64HSPL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":287446,"name":"48x72Inch Sequin Tablecloth Rectangle-Hot Pink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jNk2F+gKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤ WHAT YOU GET : 1pc 48x72-Inch rectangular hot pink sequin table cloth ❤ NO DROPPING SEQUINS : serged edges avoid falling sequins, beautiful colors of sequin tablecloth ensure your wedding party birthday christmas prom decoration dessert cake tables more elegant and sparkly ❤ SEAMLESS : made of sequin mesh fabric , SEAMLESS DESIGN. No seam in sequin table linen sparkly sequin tablecloth ❤ NO THIN,NOT THROUGH : full dense sequins embroidered on mesh fabric, making glitter tablecloths not easily see through. PLS NOTED: Pictures displayed on different displays will have a partial chromatic aberration ❤ 100% SATISFACTION : If you are not completely satisfied with our products, please feel free contact us. We will offer you a replacement or a full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jNk2F+gKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ShinyBeauty","source_asin":"B08MX8YPN4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-287446","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MX8YPN4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MX8YPN4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":287447,"name":"Frankenstein and His Wife by Richard Wallich, 12x19-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91N4qwWR3uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features Frankenstein's monster and bride. American impressionist Richard Wallich has spent more than 30 years honing his painting talents. He studied painting and figure drawing at the American Academy of Art in Chicago, Illinois, where he first worked in realism, but found the style too time-consuming. He soon discovered that impressionism allowed him to work much faster and more spontaneously, so that he could really immerse himself in the painting. Among other high honors, Richard was commissioned by the NFL in 1989 to paint for the Super Bowl and in 1996 he was the official artist for the Summer Olympics in Atlanta, Georgia. He has since been commissioned by several large companies such as Coca Cola, M & M Mars and American Airlines. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91N4qwWR3uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00HVAIFOA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-287447","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00HVAIFOA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00HVAIFOA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
