window.products.push({"id":287449,"name":"Travel Coffee Mug, 2 Pack Vacuum Insulated Coffee Travel Mug Spill Proof with Lid and Straw, 14 oz Reusable Coffee Tumbler for Keep Hot/Ice Coffee,Tea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SAYeNW+NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ 【2 in 1 Lid】Upgrade the lid with 2 ways to drink, you can drink cold through the straw, also flip the lid to drink hot, more convenient. And we offer 2 straws as a bonus. ✅ 【Keeps Cold and Hot for Hours】The vacuum insulated coffee tumbler has maximum temperature resistance. The double wall insulation ensures that hot drinks stay warm for 6 hours and cold drinks stay cold for 9 hours; Meeting your various needs. ✅【Screw-on Leak-proof Lid】Our travel coffee mugs are 100% spillproof. Featuring a screw-on lid design, the silicone seal on the lid is leak-proof. Ensures it will not leak when knocked over or placed in a bag. ✅【Perfect Capacity】400ml capacity coffee mug with matching colours, beautiful design and light body brings you a good feeling of use. You can enjoy your coffee, tea, wine and juice very well. And feel energised for the day. ✅【Double Walled Stainless Steel Coffee Tumbler】The BPA-free coffee travel mug is made of durable 18/8 stainless steel material that is sturdy and keeps drinks odor free. The exterior is fingerprint resistant with a frosted look and comes with a cleaning brush for easy cleaning. ✅【Wide Application】This to go coffee mug fits most car cup holders. Suitable for everyday use at home, office, outdoors, sports, travelling, camping and driving. You can hold it comfortably or put it in your backpack or car cup holder. ✅【Gifts and Aftersales】This 2 pack travel mug has been carefully designed with a colour coordinated. Modern and stylish! Perfect for Thanksgiving, Christmas and Valentine's Day gifts for family, couples and friends. If you have any questions with your purchase, please feel free to contact our after-sales. We will give you a satisfactory answer within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SAYeNW+NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XIAPIA","source_asin":"B0BVY9FQS7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-287449","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVY9FQS7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVY9FQS7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
