window.products.push({"id":287627,"name":"Three Geese Lightweight Down Blanket for Hot Sleeper, Summer Down Comforter with 21oz Fill Weight,100% Skin-Friendly Cotton,Queen Size 90x90 inches,75","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91RlcoWWjjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LIGHTWEIGHT COOL COMFORTER QUEEN SIZE: down comforter is 90 x 90 inches, filled with 75% duck down, 21 oz fill weight, making a lightweight but very warm for year-round use.Our lightweight down comforter is recommended for those that like to keep their bedroom on the warmer side or those that like to sleep with additional layers. TOP QUALITY Filled with ethically sourced and responsibly harvested 75% duck down and 25% feather follows the Responsible Down Standard ,Down Pass, OEKO-TEX100, OEKO-TEX1000, IDFL to ensure quilted comforter's quality, safety. No live plucking. Luxurious 750 fill power with superior resilience.That's why the down comforter will have a cloud -like fluffy feeling. LUXURY SOFT & COMFORT: Luxurious ultra-soft 1000 TC with 100% Egyptian cotton. It is suitable for sensitive skin. Breathable, skin-friendly, down-proof and gentle-touching, not crinkly provide you a noiseless and snug night sleep.It can absorb sweat when a person gets too warm,also trap a body's energy to warm up the person when he or she gets cold. It's time to rest your weary body. EXQUISITE DETAILS: The baffle box design keeps the down evenly in place for maximum warmth, durable use and fluffy look. Exquisite hemming to provent down from leaking and keep it durable.8 stitched loops for a secure duvet cover fit. A vacuum duvet bag is included for storing to keep the down comforter dry and fresh.Simple but elegant design, fits various type of decoration, adding more beauty and coziness to your bedroom. EASY CARE: The comforter is vacuum packed flatly with zero fluffy when you receive it. Open the packaging, then flap it and shake it for several times to recover its original fluffiness. Or Tumble at low temperature for 10-15 minutes in a dryer.Spot clean if necessary. Recommended with a comforter cover. Tumble dry in low heat. If you are not satisfied with our comforter, please contact us without any hesitation. We focus on customer satisfaction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91RlcoWWjjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Three Geese","source_asin":"B09NKBJ536","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-287627","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NKBJ536","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NKBJ536","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
