window.products.push({"id":287697,"name":"Shower Curtain Rings Plastic Hooks Solid and Clear Color Set of 12 Clear Turquoise Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RvyGG3hkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This set of 12 shower curtain rings is made of durable plastic and just slips easily over the curtain rod with no snaps and no clips. They feature an open side that can be slid onto the curtain and through the rod with minimal effort and they instantly update your bathroom decor. Wipe clean. Height 2.36-Inch and length 1.57-Inch, diameter 0.3-Inch. Collection of 11 colors available, solid or clear. Imported from France, made in PRC. Easy to use, these shower curtain hooks are perfect to match with your shower curtain and adds a decorative touch to your bathroom!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RvyGG3hkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Evideco French Home Goods","source_asin":"B07ZWLPLBN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-287697","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZWLPLBN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZWLPLBN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":287698,"name":"Mapletina Reusable Silicone Food Storage Bags, Airtight Seal Food Preservation Bag, Food Grade Versatile Silicone bags for Sandwich, Liquid, Snack, Me","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ADQMionUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why Choose Mapletina Reusable Silicone Food Bags? ✔Our silicone food storage bags are freezer safe, microwave safe, dishwasher safe, and steamer safe!You can store your food safely. ✔Silicone bags can be reused, not easy to crack. Reduced the use of plastic bags and saved your money. ✔Silicone food bags will not leak and can hold liquid for easy carrying and camping. You can also usea dry erase marker to write on the silicone bag to make a distinction. ✔Food preservation bags are equipped with a hanging hole design, which is easy to dry after cleaning and save space. How to open and close the silicone bag? Pull the slider to the opposite direction of the arrow to open the silicone food bag. Slide the plasticclosing rod from the left (where the loop is not) to the right to close the silicone food bag. Specification: Material: food-grade silicone Color: transparent, green, blue, orange Dimensions: 4 × large 10.8\" x 8.3\"/ 4 × medium 9\" x 6.9\" Gift: 1 × 4.1-inch diameter silicone scrubber Temperature resistance: -40°F~ 446°F Warm Tips: 1. Before using the silicone food bag for the first time, soak it in hot water for 10-15 minutes to effectivelyremove odors and make it easier to open the silicone bag. 2. Please remove the pull bar before heating; keep some breathable places when the refrigerator is frozen. 3. As time passes, the pull bar is easier to slide or a small amount of oil can be added. 4. Due to lighting, display, manual measurement, and other factors, the color and size between the picture andthe actual object may be slightly different. We sincerely hope that you can understand! Thank you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ADQMionUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mapletina","source_asin":"B08611C119","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-287698","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08611C119","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08611C119","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
