window.products.push({"id":287709,"name":"JOBKIM& Gravity Electric Pepper Grinder, Automatic Salt and Pepper Mill Grinder, Battery Powered, Adjustable Roughness, Blue LED Light, One Hand Opera","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nikyRTOzL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Get ready to enjoy the gravity pepper grinder! Unique design&Function: Suitable for all spices.Coriander Seeds, Mustard Seeds, 4 Color Peppercorns, White Peppercorns, Black Pepper, Himalayan Pink Salt, Kosher Salt, Sea Salt and much more.Just grind your spices to release their freshness. Specifications: Material — Stainless steel , ABS, acrylic.Size — About 2.48 * 7.87 inchesBattery — 6 * AAA batteries ( not included ) How to use : Easily refill.Just simply screws stainless steel top off the wide opening, and refill it easily with no mess.  Easily adjust.Simply turn the dial clockwise for a finer grind and counterclockwise for a more coarse grind. Easily see.The blue light will turn on when you are making a delicious food. You can see the pepper and salt you put in the food. Easily use.Just fill the spice at the bottom, turn the top to fill the battery, adjust the roughness.and then simply turn over the grinder to start grinding. When you use it, the blue LED light will turn on. How to clean: Just wipe down the grinder mechanism(Do Not place the grinder mechanism in Dishwasher)Glass bottle is dishwasher safe.1.Twist the cap counterclockwise to take it off.2.Rotate and pull open the bottom cover.3.Twist the coarseness adjusting knob counterclockwise until it comes out.4.Air dry the parts then reassemble it according to the structure chart. Note: Do Not place the grinder mechanism in DishwasherIt requires 6 AAA batteries (not included)If the equipment is not used for a long time, please take out the battery","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nikyRTOzL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOBKIM&","source_asin":"B09BV73YHT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-287709","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BV73YHT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BV73YHT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
