window.products.push({"id":287740,"name":"QUAFFER Double Bubble Layered Shot Glass Plus Recipe Card – Chaser Shot Glass Jigger for Smooth Shots – Fun Unique Split Shot Glasses Barware (1.25oz ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ojRI2QMFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SMOOTH TASTY SHOTS: The original double bubble shot glass that allows you to serve bomb shots in style. Patented layered shape allows you to serve the shot and chaser in 1 glass, so the last thing you taste is the chaser. 2.25 oz on the bottom, 1.25 oz on top. No magic or witchcraft involved: just the simple laws of physics we all learned in school. Liquor is less dense than most chasers, so the liquids naturally want to separate. FUN! & UNIQUE - One of a kind presentation & visual experience! Clear for visibility of contents and to coordinate with most tableware, drinkware, and decorations. Great for Bars, Restaurants, Catering Events, Night Clubs, and Bachelor or Bachelorette Parties! PREMIUM DURABLE GLASS - Crafted from premium quality & durable glass, Quaffer glasses won’t break easily. They have superior resistance to impact and daily wear, making them suitable to use in bars and other commercial setups. Glasses feature a weighted base which reduces tipping and helps prevent mess. DISHWASHER SAFE - After party clean up made more easy and time-saving! Quaffer shot glasses are dishwasher safe which makes cleaning and maintenance a breeze. After the party, simply wash them with water and soap or directly put in the dishwasher for hassle-free and mess-free cleanup. GREAT GIFT: Comes with a recipe card so that you can get the most fun out of your shots, with recipes for whiskey, rum, Jager, tequila, and vodka. Recipes include classics such as the Irish Car Bomb and Lemon Drop, to more daring recipes like the Shady Lady, Kamikazee, and the Freddy Fudpucker. To set up your shot, simply pour in the chaser first and then pour alcohol on top against the inside of the glass (not directly into the bottom chamber). Every shot you drink will be more palatable because you will immediately taste the chaser following the alcohol, so no more cringing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ojRI2QMFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"QUAFFER","source_asin":"B0B23M9H1M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-287740","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B23M9H1M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B23M9H1M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
