window.products.push({"id":287809,"name":"ZINUS GOOD DESIGN Award Winner Justina Metal Mattress Foundation / 16 Inch Platform Bed / No Box Spring Needed, Twin XL","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":133.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818I9YR0-eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Supportive, sturdy and easy on the eyes too, this foundation is your one-and-done solution for convenient mattress support. Featuring a durable steel frame and solid wood legs, this standing box spring features simple, bolt-free assembly and comes with all parts and instructions needed for quick set-up. And this ingenious foundation is available in a variety of colors and sizes, meaning you can furnish every bedroom in the house! In fact, it’s a recipient of the 2019 GOOD DESIGN Award for its unparalleled standing design, bolt-free assembly, durability and compact structure. The frame makes bedtime quick, convenient and definitely comfortable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818I9YR0-eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zinus","source_asin":"B09D3MN6QK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-287809","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09D3MN6QK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09D3MN6QK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":287810,"name":"Kenney 5/8\" Fast Fit Milton Easy Install Curtain Rod, Pewter, 66\"-120\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.54,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GJsWz57JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Fast Fit Milton Easy Install Curtain Rod by Kenney is as easy to hang as a picture frame. The innovative Fast Fit bracket securely holds up to 25 pounds and mounts with two small nails making it virtually damage free. The 5/8 inch diameter metal rod adjusts to fit your window and features decorative resin finials in pewter finish. The rod projects 2.88 inches from the wall and is recommended for light to medium weight curtains. The Kenney Fast Fit Milton Easy Install Curtain Rod is secure, stylish and simple to install with no drilling required. Mounting hardware and instructions are included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GJsWz57JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kenney","source_asin":"B0BGVXZ67N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-287810","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGVXZ67N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGVXZ67N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":287811,"name":"Fagor Stainless Steel 4-Piece Multi-Pan Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Q6hCCs7sL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Fagor 4 piece multi-pan set includes a 8.5 inch saute pan, steamer insert, egg poacher insert with 4 non-stick egg cups, glass lid and recipe book Amazon.com This nifty pan set can poach eggs, steam asparagus, and sauté mushrooms, not all at the same time, but still, the compact unit is impressive. The 8-1/2-inch sauté pan and sturdy steamer are both made of durable 18/10 stainless steel (the pan in a brushed finish), as are the long handles. When you want to poach eggs instead of steam veggies, place the poaching frame in the steamer, with water below in the pan and the glass lid on top. The four egg cups are lined with a nonstick surface, and each has its own handle, as does the frame itself. After cooking, all the parts can go into the dishwasher. A recipe book is included to get your creative juices flowing. Founded in Spain, Fagor manufactures home appliances and cookware with a \"green\" focus on environmentally-sound working conditions for employees and energy efficiency for consumers. In Europe, Fagor holds environmental stewardship awards, and in the U.S. is a participant in the Energy Star program, a government-backed program to help protect the environment. One of Fagor's most popular products is the pressure cooker, which is gaining momentum as a healthy, time-saving, and energy-saving method of cooking for today's lifestyles. --Ann Bieri What's in the Box Multi-pan set. The set consists of: 8-1/2-inch sauté pan; 4-egg poaching frame and cups; steamer insert with handle; and glass lid. 4 pieces total. From the Manufacturer Fagor is Green: Fagor's mission is to use resources efficiently to preserve the environment and save energy, developing highly efficient products that consume less and save money; contributing to a healthy planet for us and our future generations. From a social perspective, Fagor's environmental policy strategy offers advantages to both workers and consumers. It provides workers with environmentally-appropriate working conditions, which, among other benefits, minimizes and eliminates the handling of hazardous materials, while for consumers, the end-users of Fagor's products and services, it allows for efficient use of the appliances, which reduces energy and water consumption. Fagor has manufacturing systems established to minimize environmental impact on soil, water, energy, and air during the production process. There is also proper waste management and recycling procedures in place after the manufacturing process is completed. In addition to numerous European product certifications and environmental stewardship awards, Fagor is also notably a participant in the Energy Star program in the USA, a joint program of the Environmental Protection Agency and the Department Of Energy. Products that bear the energy star label allow consumers to recognize such products that have been manufactured to save money and protect the environment through energy efficient products and practices.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Q6hCCs7sL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fagor","source_asin":"B000ILA736","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-287811","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000ILA736","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000ILA736","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":287812,"name":"PREMIUM ACACIA Cutting Board & Professional Heavy Duty Butcher Block w/Juice Groove - Extra Large (17\"x13\"x1.4\") Organic, End Grain Chopping Block. Id","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91la71Q0ztL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ Bigger Is Better – Our Acacia wood cutting board for meat has the recommendation and approval of professional chef Charlie Fadida, who knows size matters for wood cutting boards. Our kitchen board and chop board is superior to the competition, so compare before you buy: at 17\" x 13\" x 1.4\" and 7 lbs. weight, our extra large Acacia cutting board is larger, thicker, and more versatile. Our thick and heavy acacia chopping board is ideal for frequent use, including as a serving tray. ✅ Knife-Friendly and Durable – Our Acacia wood cutting board tray will outlast most of your other kitchen tools! High quality construction and end grain cutting board design is more attractive than a traditional wooden cutting board or bamboo block, more durable, and scratch resistant. Acacia is a preferred wood for kitchen performance: high density provides a safe chopping surface that won't damage your knives. Designed for use by professional chefs and frequent use in home and kitchen. ✅ High Performance Design – Our Acacia chopping block is pre-treated with mineral oil, is reversible, and includes built-in handles and juice groove. Acacia is harder than most other woods, with superior scratch resistance. Acacia is resistant to liquid absorption. This wooden chopping block is less prone to cracking or warping than bamboo and easy to clean. ✅ Outstanding Quality – SoulFino has a full line of high quality, natural wood cutting boards, including maple wood and bamboo chopping boards. Check our storefront for more. Acacia is a great kitchen choice, unlike plastic or synthetic materials. Acacia is a very attractive wood, with distinctive color and grain patterns that make a definitive style impact. Great buy for cool kitchen stuff, a bridal shower present, wedding present, or a housewarming gift. ✅ Serve in Style – SoulFino Acacia Chopping Board Looks Great on any Kitchen Counter, Offering a Clean and Elegant Look that Blends in with All Types of Décor. Can Double as an Attractive SERVING TRAY or Trivet. Side Handles Make It Convenient to Use this Chic Board to Serve Sliced Meats, Cheese, Fruit & More.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91la71Q0ztL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SOULFINO","source_asin":"B0B184V7WG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-287812","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B184V7WG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B184V7WG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":287813,"name":"Pixel Gamer Drawstring Laundry or Gift Bag Storage Video Game Sack for Kids Mining Craft Gamer, 36x24 inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.33,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MzXDf3w3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Gamers will rejoice over this drawstring laundry bag! Imagine getting this as a gift, or getting a gift wrapped inside this bag! Each laundry bag is made of 100% recycled polyester (RPET) and printed with bright, pixel fun colors. Flat size is 36 inches tall and 24 inches wide, perfect size for kids to take care of their own chores! These bags are also great to wrap large Mine-craft or gamer birthday gifts or used as pixel party decor. Machine wash cold and air dry. Our goal at Think Green Fun is to make creative party goods that are fun, educational, and as Earth-friendly as possible. Our mission is provide products that have recyclability or can be reused or repurposed. No matter what color scheme your party or event is, you can always Think Green Fun! * RPET stands for recycled polyethylene terephthalate, or recycled PET. PET is a strong, durable and recyclable material that is used for soda bottles, water bottles and food jars. RPET is produced by collecting, sorting and recycling PET, then refining the material into flakes that can be turned into new products like these bags!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MzXDf3w3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Think Green Fun","source_asin":"B09WQN7F5R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-287813","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WQN7F5R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WQN7F5R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
